**Why Not Caught:** The test at line 62-65 (`HasPreviousPage_OnSecondPage_ReturnsTrue`) only tests page 2, which passes for all mutations. Only page 1 behavior is tested to expect `false`, but tests never explicitly verify that page 0 (invalid) or edge transitions are impossible.

