public bool HasNextPage => PageIndex < TotalPages;
```

**Hypothetical Mutations Not Caught:**
- `PageIndex <= TotalPages` (off-by-one: would return true on last page)
- `PageIndex < TotalPages - 1` (would return false one page early)
- `PageIndex != TotalPages` (different operator, same result in many cases)

**Why Not Caught:** Line 69-72 tests last page (returns false) with 10 items / 5 per page = 2 total pages, testing page 2. This passes for the mutation `PageIndex <= TotalPages` because page 2 is still `<` 2. The test never validates edge where `PageIndex == TotalPages`.

